Afternoon tea is one of those timeless activities that never really goes out of fashion. It also offers the perfect opportunity to catch up with friends and family (we all have plenty of that to do this year) in a relaxed but stylish environment.
Afternoon Tea is served in the beautifully elegant Drawing Room and has become one of the most sought-after traditions among guests at the 5 Star resort.
To let you fully enjoy the experience and the food, Afternoon Tea is served in two sittings, with the first at 2pm and the second at 4pm. Picnic Afternoon Tea
