**The hotel requires booking 24 hours in advance in addition to a deposit.
Looking to couple an afternoon tea experience WITH some spa time – look no further. Clanard Court Hotel offers both classic afternoon tea options with the option of spa treatment add-ons and also caters to younger audiences with a customised menu for the smallies.
Classic Afternoon Tea is €50 per stand (serves 2 people)
