Kildare Village is a relaxed shopping haven, where spacious boutiques showcase the world’s leading fashion and lifestyle brands at discount prices. Kildare shopping village also has a range of restaurants, cafes and outdoor eating areas for you and girls to make a day of it!
If it’s some escapism you need, look no further than The K Spa at the extravagant 5 Star K Club Hotel & Resort. Hidden in a luxury oasis of calm and tranquillity the 20,000 sq ft, K Spa incorporates seven luxurious treatment rooms, two private suites which are ideal for couple’s treatments or groups and their own aromatic herbal garden.
