We all know the Kildare is the HOME of horse-racing and equestrian activity in Ireland, so if you’ve got a horseracing lover in your life – a gift card for the Curragh, Naas or Punchestown Racecourse OR the National Stud and Gardens is odds on favourite to be a winner. Each year, the Curragh hosts Ireland’s five most important flat races, known as the Classics.
Now is your chance to make sure you don’t miss any of the action for the 2022 season – with memberships and race packages available from the end of November via the website
From €179, it includes admission to all 22 fixtures in 2022, including the much-anticipated 2022 festival. If you’re looking for something more flexbile Punchestown Gift Vouchers can be used to purchase tickets, hospitality and members club badges.
With a history dating back to 1180, Kilkea Castle captures the mystical charm of a 12th Century majestic Castle with the overwhelming allure of timeless sophistication and style.
Give the gift of Michelen magic with a voucher to enjoy one of the fabulous Aimsir food experiences including the Tasting Menu containing 18 courses of seasonal Irish ingredients.
For more relaxed dining in the Kildare countryside, a gift voucher for The Mill Restaurant to savour classic Irish cuisine from Chef Sean Smith will delight any foodie in your life.
