This month we’re launching a behind the scenes tour. So, we race on 23 race days a year, and having a wonderful new facility, we want to share that with people all year round!
A lot of the tour focuses on the jockey’s changing room which is strictly off limits on race days. Visitors will find out what it’s like to be a young jockey and discover their journey towards becoming a senior jockey.
