Kildare Village: While it needs no introduction, it’s safe to say Kildare Village is the home of affordable but luxurious style in Ireland. Located in Kildare Town, it’s the perfect stop to pick yourself up a designer bargain in any one of their 100 boutiques.
In addition to their flagship store, it also plays host to the Museum of Style Icons and the Craft Factory which are both open for walking tours. Separately, the café, Domo Emporium, is HIGHLY recommended if you’re looking for a spot of lunch, a sweet treat, or just an old-fashioned tea or coffee.
