If we use an authentication platform, we will receive a notification in the application with three numbers, the number that is displayed on the web that we want to access is the number that we must select in the application.
What is the use of activating two-step authentication in Fortnite
Another reason that does not invite you to activate two-step authentication in Fortnite is to be able to get the items that the platform periodically gives away. In addition, it is also necessary to be able to participate in tournaments, regardless of whether the prizes are money or skins.
Once we have selected the method that we want to use to protect our Fortnite account, we just have to follow the steps that the application shows us.
We must open the application and scan the QR code that is displayed on the screen.
We must enter the mobile phone number that will be used to receive the verification code. We will receive a code by SMS that we must enter on the web.
We will receive an email with a code that we must enter on the web.
How to disable two-step authentication in Fortnite
In the right column, we scroll to the bottom and uncheck the type of authentication that we have established. A warning message will be displayed informing us of the risks of disabling this type of authentication.
