Massage gun and foam roller: which is better for recovery?
According to Dr. Wickham, typical modern lifestyles often lack rotational movement, such as shredding on the right side or picking up things and placing them on the left side. On the contrary, whether in the gym or in daily life, we tend to focus on forward and backward exercises, such as walking, squatting, and running.
Effective activity procedures will include muscle and fascia release techniques using foam rollers or massage guns, active stretching and muscle activation techniques. â???
Foam rolling and massage guns are considered a manual therapy, which refers to any technique that sends input to your nervous system to relax your muscles and connective tissue, ultimately increasing the range of motion around the muscles or joints. Contrary to popular belief, foam rollers and massage guns do not physically break muscle knots; instead, they stimulate the nervous system to relax the tension of surrounding tissues.
When you use effective techniques to foam-roll a tight muscle group, you will almost immediately reduce the tension of the muscle group and be able to move your joints through a larger range of motion. The disadvantage is that this reduced muscle tone usually only lasts for a few hours-or at most a day or two, -?
â???? In addition, massage guns such as Theragun Prime in the picture above are smaller, more portable, and easier to use, but they are also more expensive.
By constantly hitting the muscles and releasing pulses into deep muscle tissue, our massage gun can effectively relieve muscle and joint soreness. It's a good companion for healthier life.
We take all your needs into account. Choose the speed that best suits your need, and change up the massagers head to more precisely target different body parts and muscle groups.
Equipped with 2500mAh rechargeable lithium-ion battery, percussion massage gun can keep working up to 12 hours.
Designed with super quiet high-torque motor, no need to worry about making noise that affects others. Besides, it features ultra-strong heat dissipation function, which keeps the muscle massager more durable.
Our massage guns are supplied with 17 portable, easy to clean interchangeable heads. Together the different heads support a variety of treatments to support your health and performance.
