News - How to use eye protection lamp correctly
Recent a few years, adolescent produces “myopia” the problem is more and more serious, curate everyday in the home, outdoor activity reduces greatly, the time that sees TV, play game rises gradually more, add all sorts of study… . Long time of excessive use of eyes, it is easyto cause children visual fatigue, cause vision loss.
Many parents think that the main culprit that causes children’s myopia is “electronic products”, in fact, eye lamp is also one of the “killers”.
But seemingly in order to protect children’s eyes, in fact, it is easy to harm the children.
But in the subsequent sampling of the products, found that more than half of the eye lamp problems, such as high color temperature, brightness is not qualified, blue light strobe, etc., and these problems will cause irreversible damage to children’s vision.
A sales personnel from the explosion of inferior eye lamp: not mark the lamp that protect an eye, protect an eye certainly, some lamp brightness is too strong, stare at for a while dazzling, eye distension, use to the child, it is really harm the child.
If it is higher than 4000K, it may cause damage to your eyesight.
Illuminance is the brightness of the lamp. Choose a light with 300-500 lumens and small shadows.
Brightness is too low, the light is dark, can cause visual fatigue, easy to cause myopia after a long time; Too much light can make your eyes glare, which can cause eye pain and headaches.
Put lampshade on the lamp, can avoid the eye that the light irradiate us directly, achieve the effect that protects an eye thereby.
The height of the lamp is too low, so that the scope of light exposure is too small, easy to make the eyes feel tired, resulting in myopia; While the height of the lamp is too high, the light will directly illuminate our eyes, making them dizzy and speeding up the decline of vision.
Place it properly
Such a position, writing will not affect the light because of the hand occlusion, resulting in eye fatigue.
