Hydro forming is also known as “internal high pressure forming”, its basic principle is to pipe as billet, in the pipe internal application of ultra-high pressure liquid at the same time, the two ends of the tube billet exert axial thrust, feeding. Under the joint action of two kinds of external forces, the tube material is plastic deformed, and finally fits with the inner wall of the mold cavity, and the shape and precision of the hollow parts meet the technical requirements.
