add_ship X: you are going to add a specified ship and the desired quantity of it, so both ship and its quantity must be entered.
cashX: establish the money you are going to have where X is indicated.
engineering X: sets the level of engineering you have based on the value you enter in X.
influence X: set the influence you have based on the value you use in X.
kill_pop ID: you eliminate the population you specified in ID.
free_government: you are going to change governments without having to wait.
ores X: The amount of minerals you have is determined based on the value entered in X.
