army Add a specific number of units in the selected province.
coat_of_arms Print the country shield / flag script in logs \ games.log. This is the only way to see the script for the flags generated by the game.
control Control the territory specified by the specified country.
destroy_mercenaries Destroy all the mercenaries on the world map but do not prevent them from reappearing.
event Triggers an event for the specified character / province / country.
wow Activates / deactivates fog of war.
horde Create a barbarian horde of 100k units in the specified province.
instantpopclass Activate and deactivate the promotion and instant downgrade of all your pops in a monthly tick
manpower Add the specified amount of Manpower. Note that the number is taken in thousands so "20" would result in 20.000 manpower.
prestige Modify your prestige.
The quantity is optional and if the quantity is not specified, 1 technological level is obtained. It does not unlock inventions and can make it impossible to do so.
tweak fow Open the tweaker GUI to enable or disable fog of war.
