What to do if your Fortnite account has been hacked?
Fortnite is one of the most popular games of the last two years, which has a huge legion of fans around the world. For many users, keeping their account protected is important.
The way to activate this verification or authentication It is easy in two steps, which we can do in all the accounts we have, regardless of the platform on which we are playing the popular Epic Games title. So if you were planning to improve the security of your account or you suffered a problem, such as a hack, it is a good option to consider.
3 What to do if your Fortnite account has been hacked
First we will have to log into our Fortnite account, on the platform where you play in your case. When you have already logged into your account, the steps to follow are the following:
Choose the one you want, although by email it can be convenient, if you already have a verified email. If you don't have it, they will send you an email to verify the account and that you can use it.
Enter the code every time you want to enter.
Unfortunately, there are cases where the worst fears become real and your account is hacked. There are several things that can be done, depending on the seriousness of the matter, and whether or not we still have access to the account, since this is something that clearly limits the action plan.
In this case, when logging in, click on "I have forgotten my password." Then a recovery link will be sent to the email, with which we should be able to access the account again and from there change then the password, for one that is secure and that prevents hackers from continuing to access it.
