This game in the purest Pokémon style is an MMO that takes us to a world full of the most curious creatures. Our task in this world is to capture all these creatures that we meet, very Pokémon style.
6 Advance slowly but surely
The important thing is that we are going to improve our creatures in their statistics, so that they will be better and can compete in combat properly. In the game there are 7 different values or types of statistics, which are those that influence various aspects of combat.
Defense (DEF)andSpecial Defense (SPD) determine the resistance of a TemTem against Physical and Special Techniques. The higher the defense and the special, the less points of damage you will receive from Physical and Special Techniques.
A fight can be complex, because our TemTem they can know up to 4 techniques that are going to be used in them, so that we can hurt rivals. As happens in games like Pokémon, the techniques belong to different types, so it is good to take this into account as well, because we must use those that cause the most damage to the enemy, without surprises in this sense.
Adding them to the team assumes that We are taming or taming these wild TemTem. This is something that will help us in many cases, especially with some that are more complex to find, because they could be a great help in the team, being in fact the one that helps us win many of the fights in which we participate.
TemTem also allows creatures to evolve, something that we already know from games like Pokémon, although in this case it is something that is done through other rules, so it is essential for us to know how it works. A key aspect in this case is that do not evolve when a predetermined or unchanging level is reached, but they evolve by going up a certain amount of levels from the moment we capture them or evolve from their previous form.
Another element inspired by Pokémon is that we have to choose a creature at the beginning of it. This is something that has great importance, because each of those TemTem at the beginning of the game it's going to adapt to the way we play.
Advance slowly but surely
The best thing is that when we start to play, the first hours of play be something calm. That is, we must not go too fast, but we must maintain a good rhythm, gradually gain experience.
1 How Among Us works
When a new murderer is discovered, a round of discussion is held, where each user goes to be able to vote and say who you think the imposter is in this game. The most voted will have to leave the ship, but if it is the impostor, then the game ends.
We cannot influence the game in any way so that we are the ones to become this character. So we will simply have to enter games and wait for us to be the ones chosen to be the impostor.
In addition, avoid running too fast, because this will make others suspect us immediately. You have to act as if you were innocent and look busy, like you are doing another task.
Kill fast at the beginning: If you kill quickly when the game starts, this is a good way to get several players out of the way without raising suspicions.
Kill the smart ones: There are players who are especially smart, so it is best to kill those rapids, since this way you will be able to stay in Among Us for longer.
Hide well: You only have to kill if you are sure that no one is going to see you do it. If there is another player who sees you killing, then the cameras will glow red so that is a clear indicator.
One of the best options to make life difficult for the other crew members in Among Us is to sabotage. It gives us a good help to be able to win the games, so that nobody will be able to find out that you are that imposter.
Create traps: If you sabotage a location and expect players to move in that direction, wait in corners or behind walls to kill them. Also actions such as turning off the lights or hacking communications create ideal moments to kill someone.
Hinders: If you prevent players from completing tasks, since you have sabotaged something, it is another good opportunity to win.
It is necessary to avoid that someone see us enter or exit of one of those slits. Since if this happens, they will know that we are the impostor, so in the next vote they will expel us from the ship and it is the end of the game.
If you pretend to be performing tasks, like the rest of the users in this ship in Among Us, you are going to avoid being suspected. It is a good way to go unnoticed and thus be able to kill.
