army_loyalty Sets the army's loyalty to the specified amount.
character.age Sets the age of the character. You can also do the same for prominence; the popularity; corruption… But not for loyalty.
civil_war Starts a civil war in the specified country.
declare_war Start the war between two countries.
eagerness Check the AI's will to war.
forcepeace Force AI-generated peace offers for the specified country.
instantpopassimilation Activate and deactivate the instant cultural assimilation of all your pops per month
instant war Enable / disable instant declaration of war.
marry Arrange the marriage between two characters.
political_influence Modify your political influence.
revolt Start a revolt in the specified country.
setup_editor Open the province configuration editor where you can edit the culture; religion ... This creates a configuration file in the documents that overrides the base files.
tag Change the label to another country. All countries have a numeric label and an alphanumeric label.
warexhaustion Modify your war exhaustion. warexhaustion -10 would reduce it by 10.
