4 It can be avoided?
The Vanishing Curse is a kind of trick or cheat in the game that involves make your objects disappear when you die, everything in your inventory at the time of your death is completely removed. In this way, no one will be able to use them once this has happened.
To be able to use this curse of disappearance in the game you're going to need to have a table of enchantments, of which we have spoken to you previously. This table is where you will be able to combine the necessary elements to create said curse.
The enchantment table is a tool of enormous help in Minecraft, being the table that we will use in our enchantments or curses that we are going to use. Especially in multiplayer mode it is something that can have a great impact, since we can either improve our abilities or harm the rivals that we find ourselves in it a lot.
This curse of disappearance in Minecraft It can be a double-edged sword, as it affects us as well. But the reality is that it is something that can be worth it, especially if we have objects of great level and value in our inventory, which we seek that no one will be able to use or take away in case of our death.
Again, it is important to clarify, only what is in your inventory in the game is going to be removed when you use this curse.
One of the doubts of many users in Minecraft is if it is possible to avoid this curse of disappearance. Unfortunately, the only way to avoid it is for other users not to use it, so that this object is not deleted.
It should not be ruled out that in future Minecraft updates there are changes with said curse, so that there is a method by which to avoid or undo it. Although at the moment it is not known if there are plans for it, so it is most likely that it will not be an option that comes, at least in the near future.
