Wheat seeds: This type is obtained every time we use a bag in a block of grass or use scissors in tall grass.
Pumpkin: Pumpkins can be found in plains, savannas or taigas. If you want to obtain the seeds of said pumpkin, you have to place the pumpkin in question on the creation table and then these seeds are extracted.
These are the four types of seeds that await us in the game. We will be allowed to grow them all, so depending on what you find or have in your inventory, you can use it on your farm and thus start producing your own food, which is undoubtedly something of importance.
