Since by using those configurable pieces, we will have the option to adapt our vehicle to each circuit, so that in those classic circuits or where there are many straights, we can give greater importance to speed, while in those where there are curves and they are complex, good acceleration and stability will be key so that we can win those races in the game . This is the best we can do in such cases.
