This allows us to save time when making mistakes, in addition to moving better in areas with many curves. Although if we are in a Mario Kart 8 Deluxe circuit where there are straights, we will not be the strongest.
If what really matters to us in this case is stabilityBecause we seek to take fewer risks, we must bet on other combinations in the game. Since you have to choose a heavy rider, who will give us grip and stability.
An important aspect, which you will discover as you gain experience in Mario Kart 8 Deluxe, is the configuration of your vehicle. In the game they have configurable aspects or parts, which will allow us to adapt them to each race in a simple way, in order to enhance a different aspect depending on the route we are going to face.
