As in other games, Left 4 Dead has a series of steps with which to activate these tricks, the console that will allow us to use them in our games. The steps we have to follow are simple, only to be done in the computer version of the game.
When we have said console on the screen, we will only have to enter the trick in question, which is the command or trick that we will see in the list in the next section.
Left 4 Dead has an extensive list of tricks, in the form of those commands, which will allow us to access a multitude of options when we are playing. It involves all kinds of tricks, from activating a certain mode, obtaining some advantages such as infinite ammunition, making more zombies come out, or obtaining certain weapons with which to fight against said zombies.
z_spawn smoker: With this trick a smoker will appear.
give health: Health is topped up.
give pain_pills: You will be able to get some aspirin against pain.
third person: It allows you to put the game camera in third person.
tongue_range: Sets the maximum distance of the Smoker's tongue attack. By default it is 750.
Left 4 Dead Achievements on Steam
Absolute sweep: Your team has to incapacitate three survivors in just 5 seconds within the Shock Therapy campaign.
Billy the kid: Survive an entire campaign using only pistols.
The Man and the Tank: You have to kill a Tank without the help of anything or anyone.
Brain salad: You have to get 100 headshot kills.
Pharmaceutical: Distribute pain pills to 10 survivors.
The final battle: Complete a survival round in the final battle in the game.
Zombie maniac: You have to survive a campaign in Expert mode.
Quadruple death: Kill a total of four survivors in one life as Tank.
Scarlet dew: You have to kill 1.000 survivors using a mounted machine gun.
Honor survivor: You have to earn at least one bronze medal in all Survival levels.
Throw to the plate: Shoot a Hunter in the head when he is jumping.
