In Mario Kart 8 Deluxe there is no foolproof winning combination. Finding the balance between these variables is essential, in addition to the player's own skills, which are also what determine the success that is going to be when playing this title.
In the game we mainly find three types of cars: karts, motorcycles and ATVs. Choosing well is important, although each type of vehicle has its advantages or characteristics, which are important for us to know:
