If you already have experience in Mario Kart 8 Deluxe, you will already know that there is no ideal combination. The normal thing is that as games are played, each user develop their own style, so that you are going to give more importance to aspects such as speed or acceleration.
In simple circuits and with straights, we are going to get a lot out of this bet. Although in those where there are curves or are more complex, an error can cost us very expensive and they will attack us because we have little acceleration.
Acceleration is important in Mario Kart 8 Deluxe, but we should not bet everything on her. Although on complex tracks it is a good option, to ensure that we can compete for victory.
