And the truth is that all the objects to be obtained are varied and with a spectacular appearance. Come on, if you play with friends daily, you can have a great time with that series of objects such as inflators, drones, backpacks or even different animations for your hero and so have a good laugh together.
Saving the World is an expansion which is usually at a cost of 39,99 euros and will allow you to farm free V-Bucks, although you will always have the option of purchasing them with those euros or getting free to buy the expansion.
Another option to get free V-Bucks is access daily missions that will become available as you progress through the main story of Save the World. Yes, precisely the one that we have recommended that you play daily in order to get free V-Bucks.
Daily tasks are quite similar to the daily challenges themselves from Battle Royale mode. These tasks include missions such as eliminating X number of enemies to others in which they will have to do more with a certain hero, that is, in his class.
With these Stonewood missions we will have in our hand the possibility of getting those precious V-Bucks that we look for in Fortnite. It is a slower way than go through micropayments in this Battle Royale, but it is quite effective if we have the patience, and time, for it.
Here is a condition without equanimity, you will have to find a friend who is level 70 so that it gets into your team and you can choose to do it. It does not mean that it is tremendously difficult, since with a level around 20 you can take care of yourself, but what has been said.
