These Storm Shield missions can be found in each of the main story areas of the mission that we have recommended to do every day: Save the world.
Each one of those 4 areas feature 6 Storm Shield missions, apart from four others that are unlocked as secondary. That is, in each area you will have 10 missions which makes a total of 40 missions.
Apart from the secondary missions, we do not forget another way to get free V-Bucks: the challenges. These challenges you can reach complete them up to about 10 times to earn 50 V-Bucks for each time you complete a challenge.
That is, you will have to be watch out for those temporary missions that appear out of nowhere. It is also important to remember that the reward can only be obtained once you have completed the mission.
The reward to obtain is from 25 to 40 V-Bucks in a single mission and these can change every six hours. There is another limit that we must not forget, each day you can only get three rewards.
In Fortnite weekly events are published which are like missions other than the main ones and the secondary ones. You can find them from your own tab that you have in your favorite game: Missions on the main screen.
From the moment you have the collection book, every time that you have a duplicate object, you should check if you can add it. And is that when you complete all the pages of the book you will be eligible for that great reward of 500 V-Bucks.
